our rights over your personal data by contacting the Data Controller via email at privacy@grenergy.eu or by mail at c/ Rafael Botí 26, 28023 Madrid.\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),replace('<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1">\n<style type="text/css" style="display:none;"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\n</head>\n<body dir="ltr">\n<div class="elementToProof" style="margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nBuenas tardes Estimados,</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nJunto con saludar, Favor de su apoyo para generar una cotización por el servicio &nbsp;de limpieza &nbsp;una fosa séptica&nbsp;un nuestra planta Solar PMGD Belen, ubicada en Pudahuel.</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nFavor considerar un camión de 3m³ .</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n<u>Ubicación de planta:</u></div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nRegión: Metropolitana.</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nComuna: Pudahuel.</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nLink ubicación: <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/8ZqKfkbz5zZndUsm9" id="OWA72a18f6a-419d-b121-f4a5-e2c7bf04df21" class="OWAAutoLink">\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/8ZqKfkbz5zZndUsm9</a></div>\n<div id="Signature" class="elementToProof">\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\nAdjunto&nbsp;datos&nbsp;para cotizar:</div>\n<blockquote class="elementToProof" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding-right: 0.4em; padding-left: 0.4em; border-left: 2px solid rgb(16, 16, 255);">\n<div id="x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5030138517522532882x_m_8809567985421617893x_x_replybody1" class="elementToProof" style="margin: 0px;">\n<blockquote class="elementToProof" style="margin: 0px; padding-right: 0.4em; padding-left: 0.4em; border-left: 2px solid rgb(16, 16, 255);">\n<div id="x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5030138517522532882x_m_8809567985421617893x_x_v1x_replybody1" class="elementToProof" style="margin: 0px;">\n<div class="elementToProof" style="background-color: white; margin: 0px;">\n<p class="elementToProof" style="direct