-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">We&#x27;ve been pushing a ton of agent experience improvements, like adding an official <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/claude-connector" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>Claude Connector</u></a>, <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/codex-plugin" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Codex Plugin</a>, and <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/remote-mcp-server" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>Remote MCP server</u></a>. We also started a <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/github-secret-scanner" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>new partnership with GitHub</u></a> to keep you safe. Plus, our first-ever conference, <a href="https://resend.com/forward" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Resend Forward</a>, is coming.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Quick question:</p><blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #acb3be;color:#7e8a9a;margin-left:0;padding-left:0.8em;font-size:1.1em;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, &#x27;Roboto&#x27;, &#x27;Oxygen&#x27;, &#x27;Ubuntu&#x27;, &#x27;Cantarell&#x27;, &#x27;Fira Sans&#x27;, &#x27;Droid Sans&#x27;, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif"><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left"><strong>What do you wish agents could do with Resend?</strong></p></blockquote><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Just hit reply. We read every answer.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Claude, Codex, and Remote MCP</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/remote-mcp-server" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A black square with a white &quot;m&quot; logo and the text &quot;New Remote MCP Server&quot; on a dark background." src="https://cdn.resend.app/05e60b6e-ccd6-4ad3-8aa9-2e0881787e5f" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">We launched our remote MCP server that works everywhere. As part of our MCP initiative, we also published an official <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/claude-connector" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>Claude Connector</u></a> and a <a href="https://resend.com/changelog/codex-plugin" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Codex Plugin</a>. Use MCP with all your agents today.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/remote-mcp-server" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read the changelog</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Now supporting OAuth</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/oauth-support" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A screenshot shows a Raycast extension requesting access to a user&#x27;s Wayback Store account with options for full access or sending access." src="https://cdn.resend.app/8b4d5c37-8ccc-48c6-b494-fd5b797b6609" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">We now support OAuth connections to the Resend API. Your app opens an authorization URL, the user approves it on Resend&#x27;s own consent screen, and you get scoped access tokens back. No API keys change hands, and users can revoke access at any time.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/oauth-support" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read the changelog</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">What the new DMARC means for you</h2><a href="https://resend.com/blog/the-new-dmarc-is-here" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A metallic envelope icon next to the text &quot;The New DMARC&quot; and the word &quot;Guide&quot;." src="https://cdn.resend.app/07f06bd4-023f-4409-ba6a-f78a4933c218" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">After more than a decade of real-world use and several years of drafting, DMARC has a new specification. Here&#x27;s what changed, and what it means for your domain.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/blog/the-new-dmarc-is-here" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ View the guide</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Our new GitHub Partnership</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/github-secret-scanner" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="GitHub Secret Scanner logo on a dark background." src="https://cdn.resend.app/15f095d2-9c9b-4480-b0e1-dc09a1eff947" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Resend is now a GitHub secret scanning partner. When a Resend API key is exposed anywhere GitHub scans (public repositories, gists, issues, and more), GitHub notifies us the instant it appears and we revoke keys automatically. This protects your domain reputation in case there&#x27;s a leak.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/github-secret-scanner" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ Read the guide</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">New Vercel Integration</h2></div></div><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><table align="left" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;align:left;width:100%;color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:0px;border-color:#000000;line-height:155%"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td style="padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GjiQ0ImKXQg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="youtube youtubeContent"><img class="node-image" alt="YouTube video" src="https://cdn.resend.app/ab7ae54e-cbda-4139-b9a9-07794520574e" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px" width="100%"/><div data-node-view-content="" style="white-space:pre-wrap"></div></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Set up Resend inside Vercel&#x27;s Marketplace in just a couple of minutes, including provisioning a brand new Resend team, connecting a Vercel domain, and auto-deploying API keys to your project. No DNS wrangling, no copy-pasting env variables. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GjiQ0ImKXQg" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ Watch the video</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Message IDs now included in sent emails</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/message-id-for-sent-emails" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="JSON code snippet displaying email event data with type, timestamps, sender, recipient, and message identifiers." src="https://cdn.resend.app/a1d79ec1-e0da-4840-aa00-e262e20d5147" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">We now include <code style="padding-top:0.25em;padding-bottom:0.25em;padding-left:0.4em;padding-right:0.4em;background:#e5e7eb;color:#1e293b;border-radius:4px;background-color:#e5e7eb">message_id</code> in all email webhooks and in the retrieve and list email endpoints. This has been one of our most requested features, and it unlocks new use cases without any new primitives.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/message-id-for-sent-emails" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read the changelog</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Lenny&#x27;s agentic email workflow</h2><a href="https://resend.com/customers/lennys-newsletter" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="How Agents Power Lenny&#x27;s Newsletter with Lenny Rachitsky&#x27;s profile picture and logo." src="https://cdn.resend.app/d039aee6-6d1a-4b95-b66d-168f5c61b7a7" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Resend powers the email behind Lenny&#x27;s Data, which gives his subscribers all of his posts, podcast transcripts, and more in clean markdown, an MCP server, and a GitHub repo. He set up the entire flow using Claude Code.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/customers/lennys-newsletter" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read Lenny&#x27;s Story</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Join us for Resend Forward</h2><a href="https://resend.com/forward" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img class="node-image" alt="Resend Forward. An event for builders. Oct 21, 2026. San Francisco." src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/91e37ba1-aa47-4889-89a9-22f123baa8e7" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">We&#x27;re hosting a conference to gather builders who care about their craft. It takes place October 21, 2026 in San Francisco. Can&#x27;t wait to see you there.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/forward" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Attend Forward</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Happy sending,<br/>Zeno Rocha</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="footer" style="font-size:0.8em"><tbody><tr><td><hr class="divider" style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:transparent;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;padding-bottom:1em;border-style:solid;border-width:0;border-top-width:2px"/><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">You are receiving this email as a user of Resend.<br/><br/>Want to change how you receive these emails?<br/>You can <a href="https://unsubscribe.resend.com/?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjb250YWN0SWQiOiI4Yjg2NjI1Yi0wOWU1LTRkNWUtYjhiYy0zZDhjYzM4ZmY1OGUiLCJhdWRpZW5jZUlkIjoiMzViMWNmZjEtYzM4MS00ZDZmLTk5NGUtNDkwNGY4NTVmMmM3IiwiYnJvYWRjYXN0SWQiOiJlYWUwZjdhZC02M2YwLTQ1OGQtYWE4Yy1lZGU3YzA2M2Q5MzkiLCJ0ZWFtSWQiOiI0MGI0OGMwOS0xYmYxLTRkNjItYWYyOS03YzE2MTNkMmVkNzUiLCJleHAiOjE4MTYyNjc3NjB9.sYvIIGWD3d0OPU1H0NCuT1nYBORv3d525Y8gncL3mRw" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">unsubscribe from this list</a>.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">2261 Market Street #5039<br/><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">San Francisco, CA 94114</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>\n','\n',char(10)),'destaperapido.cl','spam','2026-07-22T16:34:58.000Z','2026-07-22 16:34:59',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'b8536d381f8886ae3cdd2eeb778c891d377127bcea2ec6bbca4d83be279cb555','s:claude, codex, and our github partnership|zeno@updates.resend.com',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "correos" ("id","message_id","de","para","asunto","cuerpo_texto","cuerpo_html","dominio","estado","recibido_en","creado_en","respuesta_borrador","respuesta_enviada","respondido_en","adjunto_nombre","adjunto_b64","notificado","ajuste_pedido","ajuste_enviar","confianza","motivo_revision","dedup_hash","thread_id","in_reply_to","referencias","leido","estado_previo","etiquetas","estado_prev_papelera") VALUES(469,'<1aefecd1bd6b4554b6c3f1fc649384a4@microsoft.com>','dmarcreport@microsoft.com','contacto@destaperapido.cl','Report Domain: destaperapido.cl Submitter: protection.outlook.com Report-ID: 1aefecd1bd6b4554b6c3f1fc649384a4',replace('\n','\n',char(10)),'<div style ="font-family:Segoe UI; font-size:14px;">This is a DMARC aggregate report from Microsoft Corporation. For Emails received between 2026-07-21 00:00:00 UTC to 2026-07-22 00:00:00 UTC.</ div><br /><br />You''re receiving this email because you have included your email address in the ''rua'' tag of your DMARC record in DNS for destaperapido.cl. Please remove your email address from the ''rua'' tag if you don''t want to receive this email.<br /><br /><div style ="font-family:Segoe UI; font-size:12px; color:#666666;">Please do not respond to this e-mail. This mailbox is not monitored and you will not receive a response. For any feedback/suggestions, kindly mail to dmarcreportfeedback@microsoft.com.<br /><br />Microsoft respects your privacy. Review our Online Services <a href ="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement">Privacy Statement</a>.<br />One Microsoft Way, Redmond, WA, USA 98052.</ div >','destaperapido.cl','bloqueado','2026-07-23T06:07:07.000Z','2026-07-23 06:07:10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'7cd31325dce854c3c64f5d008b5efcf37170d8e5d2d97843e465539345fe37f0','s:report domain: destaperapido.cl submitter: protection.outlook.com report-id: 1aefecd1bd6b4554b6c3f1fc649384a4|dmarcreport@microsoft.com',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "correos" ("id","message_id","de","para","asunto","cuerpo_texto","cuerpo_html","dominio","estado","recibido_en","creado_en","respuesta_borrador","respuesta_enviada","respondido_en","adjunto_nombre","adjunto_b64","notificado","ajuste_pedido","ajuste_enviar","confianza","motivo_revision","dedup_hash","thread_id","in_reply_to","referencias","leido","estado_previo","etiquetas","estado_prev_papelera") VALUES(470,'87c34e24-6a2b-40ea-bbba-3991febcdcc6','contacto@destaperapido.cl','Gustavo.isanhueza@gmail.com','Cotización Destape Rápido — Arriendo de baño químico en Buin',replace('Estimado Gustavo:\n\nJunto con saludar, y según lo conversado por WhatsApp, adjunto las cotizaciones formales por el arriendo de baño químico en Buin, con inicio el 18 de septiembre de 2026. El arriendo se cobra por día de servicio.\n\nResumen comercial:\n- Opción 1 baño: $100.000 neto por día · $119.000 con IVA.\n- Opción 3 baños: $70.000 neto por baño al día ($210.000 neto diario · $249.900 con IVA).\n- Incluye traslados de entrega y retiro, papel higiénico y limpieza al finalizar el servicio.\n- Visita de limpieza durante los días de arriendo (opcional): $40.000 neto por visita.\n\nEn los PDF adjuntos encontrará el detalle completo y las condiciones del servicio.\n\nQuedamos atentos para coordinar la entrega o resolver cualquier consulta. Puede escribirnos o llamarnos al +56 9 3647 0112.\n\nSaludos cordiales,\nDestape Rápido — Servicios sanitarios y arriendo de baños químicos\ndestaperapido.cl','\n',char(10)),NULL,'gmail.com','enviado','2026-07-23T14:52:06.931Z','2026-07-23 14:52:07',NULL,replace('Estimado Gustavo:\n\nJunto con saludar, y según lo conversado por WhatsApp, adjunto las cotizaciones formales por el arriendo de baño químico en Buin, con inicio el 18 de septiembre de 2026. El arriendo se cobra por día de servicio.\n\nResumen comercial:\n- Opción 1 baño: $100.000 neto por día · $119.000 con IVA.\n- Opción 3 baños: $70.000 neto por baño al día ($210.000 neto diario · $249.900 con IVA).\n- Incluye traslados de entrega y retiro, papel higiénico y limpieza al finalizar el servicio.\n- Visita de limpieza durante los días de arriendo (opcional): $40.000 neto por visita.\n\nEn los PDF adjuntos encontrará el detalle completo y las condiciones del servicio.\n\nQuedamos atentos para coordinar la entrega o resolver cualquier consulta. Puede escribirnos o llamarnos al +56 9 3647 0112.\n\nSaludos cordiales,\nDestape Rápido — Servicios sanitarios y arriendo de baños químicos\ndestaperapido.cl','\n',char(10)),'2026-07-23T14:52:06.931Z','cotizacion-20260723-gustavo-sanhueza-1-bano.pdf','',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'s:cotización destape rápido — arriendo de baño químico en buin|gustavo.isanhueza@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "correos" ("id","message_id","de","para","asunto","cuerpo_texto","cuerpo_html","dominio","estado","recibido_en","creado_en","respuesta_borrador","respuesta_enviada","respondido_en","adjunto_nombre","adjunto_b64","notificado","ajuste_pedido","ajuste_enviar","confianza","motivo_revision","dedup_hash","thread_id","in_reply_to","referencias","leido","estado_previo","etiquetas","estado_prev_papelera") VALUES(471,'8418d3ba-e3ee-47ef-b606-852c41a921df','contacto@destaperapido.cl','gustavozura94@gmail.com','Cotización Destape Rápido — Arriendo de baño químico',replace('Estimado/a Pintando,\n\nJunto con saludar, le adjunto la cotización formal por el arriendo de baño químico para su proyecto en Las Condes.\n\n- un baño químico: $130.000 neto (total con IVA: $154.700)\n- Incluye traslado, instalación, retiro, aseo semanal (cada 7 a 10 días), papel higiénico y desodorizante.\n\nEl detalle completo está en el PDF adjunto. Para confirmar basta con responder este correo o coordinarlo por WhatsApp, y agendamos la entrega.\n\nQuedamos atentos a cualquier consulta.\n\nSaludos cordiales,\nDestape Rápido\n+56 9 3647 0112 · destaperapido.cl','\n',char(10)),NULL,'gmail.com','enviado','2026-07-23T15:08:27.720Z','2026-07-23 15:08:28',NULL,replace('Estimado/a Pintando,\n\nJunto con saludar, le adjunto la cotización formal por el arriendo de baño químico para su proyecto en Las Condes.\n\n- un baño químico: $130.000 neto (total con IVA: $154.700)\n- Incluye traslado, instalación, retiro, aseo semanal (cada 7 a 10 días), papel higiénico y desodorizante.\n\nEl detalle completo está en el PDF adjunto. Para confirmar basta con responder este correo o coordinarlo por WhatsApp, y agendamos la entrega.\n\nQuedamos atentos a cualquier consulta.\n\nSaludos cordiales,\nDestape Rápido\n+56 9 3647 0112 · destaperapido.cl','\n',char(10)),'2026-07-23T15:08:27.720Z','coti-0ee5af2d290a9694.pdf','',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'s:cotización destape rápido — arriendo de baño químico|gustavozura94@gmail.com',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL);
