0056b3; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">refill your account balance</a>.</p>\n\n  <p style="color: #333333; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">To prevent your integration from dropping offline unexpectedly like this in the future, we highly recommend enabling auto-replenishment. You can learn how to set it up in <a data-pm-no-track rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://dataforseo.com/help-center/set-auto-recharge" style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">our Help Center</a>.</p>\n\n  <p style="color: #333333; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">If you need any help getting your account back up and running, please reply to this email or <a data-pm-no-track rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://dataforseo.com/contact" style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">contact our Support Team</a></p>\n\n                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n                      <tbody>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td height="25" style="font-size: 0; line-height: 25px;"></td>\n                      </tr>\n                      </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                  <td width="15">\n                    <div style="width: 15px;">&nbsp;</div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n        <![endif]-->\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F5F6FA">\n    <tbody>\n    <tr>\n        <td align="center" bgcolor="#F5F6FA" style="">\n\n            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n                <t